WEBVTT

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.967
Give this model a brushed-metal finish.

00:00:02.633 --> 00:00:05.100
Light it. Render a preview.

00:00:05.367 --> 00:00:07.467
DCC MCP lets your AI assistant

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:09.667
operate Blender and other creative software.

00:00:11.167 --> 00:00:12.967
A Skill packages your team's method.

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:15.733
MCP calls the software's tools.

00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:21.033
Save material, checking, and export steps.

00:00:21.733 --> 00:00:23.333
Reuse them on the next job.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.400
Load the instructions you need,

00:00:25.467 --> 00:00:27.433
reducing repeated code and context.

00:00:29.567 --> 00:00:30.967
Rust runs the routing core,

00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:32.867
avoiding interpreter overhead there.

00:00:33.567 --> 00:00:35.433
Host scripts can still use Python.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.300
Permissions set boundaries.

00:00:37.967 --> 00:00:39.967
Audit records help trace key calls.

00:00:40.233 --> 00:00:42.167
Find and install skills in the marketplace,

00:00:42.267 --> 00:00:44.133
then share your team's versioned workflows.

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:46.933
DCC MCP.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.067
Explore the marketplace.
